WEBVTT

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:07.640
Far, far away, in a distant time.

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:14.140
ln the outer space of this universe
there was a tribe called the Tribe of Gold.

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:20.070
They, who created planets and
had the power to foresee the future,

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:23.570
called out to the still-primitive other tribes.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:30.620
The tribes that responded to their call were

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:33.620
the Tribe of Silver,

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.620
the Tribe of Bronze,

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:42.630
and the Tribe of Hero.

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:48.720
Before long, the Tribe of Hero started a war,

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:51.970
and many tribes faced extinction.

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:56.640
When the Tribe of Gold
made them stop fighting,

00:00:56.730 --> 00:01:00.400
there were only five
survivors in the Tribe of Hero.

00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:06.950
Then the Tribe of Gold
punished those five survivors.

00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:10.240
Those five were condemned to dwell

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:13.950
within and serve tribes
weaker than their own.

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:16.250
Those within whom dwelled
members of the Tribe of Hero

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:21.250
were called "Nodos" and became the
figures to control the fate of the universe.

00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:25.760
The most powerful one of
the five survivors, Belcross,

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:31.140
entered a boy from the weakest
and newest tribe to come into space...

00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:35.970
Someone from the Tribe of Iron 
in other words, humankind.

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:38.230
A boy named Age.

00:01:39.020 --> 00:01:45.650
<b>Over and over again
I wish on the dazzling star far away</b>

00:01:45.740 --> 00:01:51.910
<b>Wandering heartbeats, gravitation,
the story of their attraction</b>

00:02:05.510 --> 00:02:12.260
<b>When did it begin?
No one knows the end of it</b>

00:02:12.350 --> 00:02:18.390
<b>It's not a trick or an illusion,
it's a current that I can't swim against</b>

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:21.190
<b>(Dark!)</b>

00:02:21.270 --> 00:02:24.650
<b>The monster that lives in the darkness</b>

00:02:26.280 --> 00:02:28.030
<b>(Blight!)</b>

00:02:28.110 --> 00:02:31.570
<b>As if I were easily getting swallowed into it</b>

00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:33.370
<b>(I seek a hero!)</b>

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:36.030
<b>I awake as I truly am</b>

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:44.750
<b>If God says conflicts and
life's old dreams go hand in hand</b>

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:49.760
<b>I'm looking for you even if
it means ripping my body apart</b>

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:58.520
<b>With a flower held to my heart, no one
can stop this heartbeat now that it's begun</b>

00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:02.640
We're destined to come in contact

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:18.080
Start up of warp system normal...

00:03:18.160 --> 00:03:21.410
Five minutes until we
intersect with the starway.

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:24.500
The ship will now enter warp flight mode.

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:27.090
Confirming the horoscope on the starway.

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:31.260
Route No. L2S-527896-CYY.

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:32.930
Specifying the astral sign.

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:35.510
Establish the link.

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:41.140
Route L2S-527896-CYY, link established.

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:44.810
Beginning acquisition of the horoscope.

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:47.310
All sails, route-sensing mode.

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:49.940
Approximately 1 80 seconds
until we determine the horoscope.

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:06.290
E-a-r-t-h.

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:08.630
The third planet of the solar system.

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:11.000
The homeland of us humans.

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:18.300
More than a century ago...

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:34.900
Hey, look at that!

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:48.080
Earth was invaded by the Tribe of Bronze,

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:51.670
and even now, we can't get
close to our solar system.

00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:57.430
The Tribe of Silver, which has
been trying to destroy humankind,

00:04:57.510 --> 00:05:00.100
and the Tribe of Bronze that works under them,

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:02.350
have continued to steal our Lebensraum.

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:17.110
Reclaiming our Earth is
our long-cherished desire.

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:21.990
And our only hope is you, Age.

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:25.620
You, who possess the Tribe of Hero within...

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:29.920
Dad and the others said that

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:33.420
when Dhianeila comes, Age goes with her.

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.550
Age has things to do.

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:41.300
Hey, can Age explore inside
the Argonaut some more?

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:44.970
Let's take a break.

00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:50.600
Tail. Mail.

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:51.480
Yes.

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:52.690
We'll go with him.

00:05:55.860 --> 00:06:00.360
Do you think we can assume
that he understands his mission?

00:06:00.450 --> 00:06:01.990
I feel that way.

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:05.740
He knew the Twelve Agreements,

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:08.790
and knows the reason why
he's on this ship right now.

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:20.130
Beginning the warp setting
according to the acquired horoscope.

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:22.970
Suspending normal functions. All sails, down.

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:26.560
Activating the dimension ripper.

00:06:29.440 --> 00:06:31.060
Warp in!

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:46.910
Exceptional area enveloping the ship's body.

00:06:46.990 --> 00:06:49.660
Astral sail, rise on Matrix A.

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:50.790
Sail expanding.

00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:53.460
Thrust distribution within acceptable range.

00:06:57.800 --> 00:07:00.470
Warp status, cruising confirmed.

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:04.680
It's been two cycles since
we last saw the starway,

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:06.430
but as of now this ship is safely back on it.

00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:09.430
And this is all thanks
to everyone's hard work.

00:07:09.520 --> 00:07:13.440
However, our journey is only half over.

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:16.400
Until we return to Altria with our savior,

00:07:16.480 --> 00:07:20.490
I urge everyone to stay
sharp and carry out your duty.

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:25.320
Bee, have the tactical program
ready in case of any encounters.

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:26.740
Yes, Master.

00:07:26.830 --> 00:07:28.660
We still have a long way to go.

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:34.920
41st to 50th Organ Units,
enter 20-minute standby.

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:39.590
21st to 30th Organ Units, you
are on reserve for duty in twelve hours.

00:07:44.220 --> 00:07:49.010
Protecting the princess and
this ship she's on is our duty.

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:51.310
How could we ever rely
on that damn monkey...

00:08:00.820 --> 00:08:01.860
Stop!

00:08:01.940 --> 00:08:03.820
You might die if you lick that!

00:08:05.820 --> 00:08:07.160
Age can't eat it?

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:09.160
That's paint!

00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:11.290
P-a-i-n-t!

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:14.250
We paint the walls and Organs with it.

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:15.960
Paint-with-it.

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:23.420
Shutting down the cargo area.

00:08:23.510 --> 00:08:25.180
Evacuate immediately.

00:08:25.260 --> 00:08:27.140
Shutting down the cargo area.

00:08:32.020 --> 00:08:34.100
Aneasha. Age is...

00:08:34.190 --> 00:08:35.310
What?

00:08:40.610 --> 00:08:42.650
Explain what happened!

00:09:10.510 --> 00:09:11.970
Good grief...

00:09:12.060 --> 00:09:15.350
I praise you for your
active interaction with him.

00:09:15.430 --> 00:09:19.440
It is possible that we could expect
some kind of educational results from it.

00:09:19.520 --> 00:09:20.690
However,

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:24.730
I certainly can't praise you for
encouraging wild behavior like this.

00:09:24.820 --> 00:09:26.360
We're sorry.

00:09:35.290 --> 00:09:39.080
To think that monkey is our
savior... How unfortunate...

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:43.250
Getting carried away with the Nodos...

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:45.210
They've got some nerve.

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:48.170
Sorry for the trouble my daughters have caused.

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:51.010
No, it was me who failed
to exercise proper oversight.

00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:56.770
Having the Nodos onboard could
end up causing panic on the ship.

00:09:56.850 --> 00:09:58.440
How should we deal with that?

00:09:58.560 --> 00:10:00.900
As far as his mission goes,

00:10:00.980 --> 00:10:02.650
Dhianeila-sama believes
that he does understand it.

00:10:02.730 --> 00:10:04.610
Take that!

00:10:04.690 --> 00:10:06.780
I agree with her on that.

00:10:06.860 --> 00:10:10.910
He has shown us that
he's willing to fight for us.

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:15.740
What just happened was
just an innocent prank.

00:10:15.830 --> 00:10:18.370
The problem is actually the crew
who've been overly sensitive about him.

00:10:18.460 --> 00:10:21.290
Everyone seems to be afraid of his power.

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:25.300
After all, we're being asked to
believe that wild boy is our savior.

00:10:25.380 --> 00:10:28.090
And now that we've all
seen the power of the Nodos...

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:30.720
I don't blame them for overreacting.

00:10:30.800 --> 00:10:32.260
Even to his simple prank.

00:10:32.350 --> 00:10:35.010
I fear we have no choice but to educate him.

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:37.770
I know it's going to be tough,
but I'm counting on you.

00:10:37.850 --> 00:10:41.230
As long as we can't control that monkey,

00:10:41.310 --> 00:10:44.190
we can't feel safe taking him back to Altria.

00:10:44.270 --> 00:10:45.570
We'll do everything we can.

00:10:46.030 --> 00:10:47.280
Starting with his appearance?

00:10:47.360 --> 00:10:48.280
Yes.

00:10:48.360 --> 00:10:50.070
Having him look more presentable

00:10:50.150 --> 00:10:53.990
could give our crew a quite
different impression of him, I think.

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:57.490
Age himself might develop

00:10:57.580 --> 00:11:00.410
some kind of self-awareness
if he dresses properly.

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:04.210
We're back.

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:06.590
You sure look clean now.

00:11:06.670 --> 00:11:08.340
Taking showers is fun, huh?

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:11.010
Well then, why don't we give him a haircut next?

00:11:11.090 --> 00:11:12.130
Huh?

00:11:17.770 --> 00:11:19.850
You don't have to be afraid.

00:11:19.930 --> 00:11:21.350
Everyone does this.

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:25.810
Just watch. Over here.

00:11:29.190 --> 00:11:31.950
It'll grow right back, even if you cut it.

00:11:32.030 --> 00:11:33.320
Just like Fuuto?

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:35.570
Yes, and it doesn't hurt, either.

00:11:49.260 --> 00:11:51.920
After the haircut, this is next.

00:11:52.010 --> 00:11:53.260
What is that?

00:11:53.340 --> 00:11:54.550
A suit.

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:55.840
What's a suit?

00:11:55.930 --> 00:11:57.760
The clothes that you wear inside the ship.

00:11:57.850 --> 00:12:00.060
This is much more comfortable.

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:02.560
Hey, where is it?

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:04.060
What?

00:12:04.150 --> 00:12:06.190
P-a-i-n-t!

00:12:09.320 --> 00:12:12.780
You can use that wall as you like.

00:12:12.860 --> 00:12:13.990
Thank you!

00:12:15.030 --> 00:12:16.910
I thought that he'd be able to

00:12:16.990 --> 00:12:19.450
change clothes with no problem, but...

00:12:19.540 --> 00:12:21.410
He accepted a haircut,

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:25.210
and showed an interest in the tools we use.

00:12:25.290 --> 00:12:26.830
It's great progress.

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:33.090
He's painting a picture.

00:12:33.170 --> 00:12:35.260
I think he's just splashing it on randomly.

00:12:57.990 --> 00:12:59.620
Wow...

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:01.530
What the heck is that?

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:03.660
That Nodos is...

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:05.120
What are you doing?

00:13:10.630 --> 00:13:13.670
I certainly didn't expect
that side of his personality.

00:13:13.760 --> 00:13:16.300
Hmm? Did he get a haircut?

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:18.590
Supposedly it was Dhianeila-sama's suggestion.

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:20.260
Just as I'd expect from the princess.

00:13:20.350 --> 00:13:22.560
She sure has him wrapped around her finger.

00:13:34.610 --> 00:13:37.070
Where is that scenery from?

00:13:37.150 --> 00:13:39.240
Olone. From a long time ago.

00:13:41.660 --> 00:13:42.450
This is a keete.

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:45.200
There were a lot more, too.

00:13:45.290 --> 00:13:47.910
Fuuto's favorite food is posto's roots.

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:50.420
But there weren't that many.

00:13:52.550 --> 00:13:53.800
Planet Olone...

00:13:53.880 --> 00:13:57.840
I can tell your wish is to revive it.

00:13:58.840 --> 00:13:59.930
It's a Nodos.

00:14:00.010 --> 00:14:02.260
No other Tribe of Iron.

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:04.930
Should we attack?

00:14:05.020 --> 00:14:06.430
The power of Nodos...

00:14:06.520 --> 00:14:08.770
Must be tested.

00:14:08.850 --> 00:14:10.020
I'll do it.

00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:12.770
Captain.

00:14:12.860 --> 00:14:14.320
What is the matter, Princess?

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:16.990
I sense very powerful murderous intent.

00:14:17.070 --> 00:14:19.570
Someone is pursuing this ship.

00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:22.620
It's probably the Tribe of Silver.

00:14:22.700 --> 00:14:23.660
What did you say?

00:14:23.740 --> 00:14:25.410
Can you pick up the enemy ship?

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:28.450
No response within the search range.

00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:31.330
But there's no doubt that an
enemy is approaching this ship.

00:14:31.420 --> 00:14:32.920
Execute the tactical program.

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:34.210
Yes, Master.

00:14:36.010 --> 00:14:38.260
After evaluating the battle plan,

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:42.260
we have determined that evacuation
via active warp would be the best choice.

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:47.930
But active warp doesn't let you
specify the route with precision...

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:53.190
The enemy can't pursue us if they don't
know where we're going to warp out.

00:14:55.860 --> 00:14:59.440
The destination is going to be
somewhere in the vast dark space

00:14:59.530 --> 00:15:01.990
between the Fallow System and the Asion System.

00:15:02.910 --> 00:15:06.410
The chance of us warping out by a large,

00:15:06.490 --> 00:15:08.370
high-mass object is close to zero.

00:15:08.450 --> 00:15:10.620
Are you saying that there's no risk involved?

00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:13.790
You could say that the risk is
extremely low, Dhianeila-sama.

00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:16.130
During the energy charge,

00:15:16.210 --> 00:15:19.300
the ship will limit the use of the shields
as well as all the energy-charged weapons.

00:15:19.380 --> 00:15:22.720
Our defenses will therefore
be lowered extremely...

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:25.970
So we will leave the starway
after the charge is completed,

00:15:26.060 --> 00:15:27.970
then begin the active warp.

00:15:28.060 --> 00:15:30.600
I don't want to leave the starway,

00:15:30.680 --> 00:15:34.230
but we can't afford to return
home accompanied by our enemy.

00:15:34.310 --> 00:15:36.940
What do you think, Princess?

00:15:37.020 --> 00:15:39.280
Understood. I approve it.

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:46.620
Go.

00:15:55.210 --> 00:15:55.960
What's wrong?

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:59.170
Multiple objects have appeared on the starway.

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:00.420
It's the Tribe of Bronze...

00:16:00.510 --> 00:16:01.760
Their ant heaps!

00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:03.050
Warp out!

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:42.510
Let's go, Belcross.

00:17:24.050 --> 00:17:26.130
Weapons system, ready!

00:17:26.220 --> 00:17:27.260
Good!

00:17:27.340 --> 00:17:29.390
Concentrate the firepower on the front!

00:17:29.470 --> 00:17:31.680
Let the Nodos handle the rear!

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:32.970
Now fire!

00:17:50.700 --> 00:17:51.700
Let's go!

00:17:51.780 --> 00:17:53.280
Don't fall behind that monkey!

00:18:55.600 --> 00:18:56.560
This is

00:18:58.850 --> 00:18:59.810
Age...

00:19:05.230 --> 00:19:06.400
The Tribe of Silver!

00:19:41.350 --> 00:19:43.100
He's just...

00:19:43.190 --> 00:19:45.270
...too much more powerful than I am...

00:19:45.360 --> 00:19:46.560
Engaging in active warp.

00:19:46.650 --> 00:19:48.270
All units, return to the ship.

00:19:55.740 --> 00:19:56.740
Nodos...

00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:22.810
Our savior...

00:20:22.890 --> 00:20:25.020
Our Nodos!

00:20:25.100 --> 00:20:26.900
Energy charge complete!

00:20:26.980 --> 00:20:28.810
Good. Let's get out of here.

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:31.030
Activate dimension ripper!

00:20:31.110 --> 00:20:34.320
Astral turbine engine at full speed! Warp in!

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:41.540
Coordinates confirmed!

00:20:41.620 --> 00:20:44.080
We're almost exactly in
the center of the target area.

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:46.920
No sign of enemy or gravitational
disturbances detected in the area.

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:51.340
Mission complete. We shook them off.

00:20:52.170 --> 00:20:57.550
This success is the result of our
power and the power of our Nodos.

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:05.600
Now this should remove some of the
worries that they have towards Age.

00:21:06.900 --> 00:21:11.440
I'm sure he will fight for
us at any time, anywhere.

00:21:11.530 --> 00:21:16.280
No matter what we think of him...

00:21:17.450 --> 00:21:19.120
The destruction and ruin

00:21:19.200 --> 00:21:21.080
engraved on your heart...

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:30.330
You feel that pain, yet for us...

00:21:45.680 --> 00:21:49.650
The princess actually touched
someone of her own volition...?!

00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:14.800
The fifth one showed up.

00:22:27.100 --> 00:22:34.230
Although I have known you for a long time

00:22:34.320 --> 00:22:42.780
l never dreamed these feelings would sprout

00:22:42.870 --> 00:22:47.910
And I would fall in love with you

00:22:48.000 --> 00:22:58.800
Casually going home,
as I look at the stars in the night sky

00:22:58.880 --> 00:23:10.640
l take the long way on purpose
and lean on your shoulder as we walk

00:23:11.480 --> 00:23:22.570
You tell me you think we can overcome
anything as long as we stay together

00:23:22.660 --> 00:23:27.870
I think as I look into your forthright eyes

00:23:27.950 --> 00:23:34.580
That I love you

00:23:37.960 --> 00:23:40.010
We encountered another
Nodos at the terminal planet

00:23:40.090 --> 00:23:42.340
where we stopped for supply replenishment...

00:23:42.430 --> 00:23:47.390
Next time on Heroic Age,
Episode 4: "The Planet Titarros."
